diligentcore provides Diligent's Vulkan CMake targets used by Karma:

  find_package(DiligentCore CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Diligent-GraphicsEngineVk-static)

This overlay port is Linux-only and packages DiligentCore v2.5.5 with Vulkan,
HLSL/SPIR-V shader compilation, and render-state cache support enabled.
